Vendored icons
--------------

The Lucide SVG files in crates/fx-design/assets/icons/ contain headers identifying
their source as lucide-static v1.52.0. Their filenames use the Swift application's symbol
names; the original Lucide glyphs are embedded by the Rust build script.

Upstream project: https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide
Source package: https://registry.npmjs.org/lucide-static/-/lucide-static-1.52.0.tgz

The complete, unmodified package LICENSE is preserved at
licenses/lucide-static-1.52.0-LICENSE. It contains the Lucide ISC license and
the original Feather MIT license and attribution for the listed derived icons.

